bullseye plot of the lists (which needs to have 17 values) provide.\\n\\ndata \
is a 3D volume used for the plot. \\nsegmask is the AHA-17 segmentation \
resulting form the CardiacSegment function when AHA17 is \
selected.\\n\\nOutput is a bullseye plot or a plotwindow, depending on the \
Method which can be \\\"Dynamic\\\" else it will be \
static.\\n\\nBullseyePlot[] is based on DOI: 10.1161/hc0402.102975.\"\>", 
